            "example": "Consider a commercial cargo airplane with a fixed maximum payload. If the airline sells guaranteed space to three separate freight forwarders across successive calls, the remaining cargo space for the airline's own baggage is strictly the remainder after subtracting all pre-sold forwarder space.",
            "code": "def simulate_multi_safe_stack(tranches: list, initial_founder_shares: int):\n    total_safe_ownership = 0.0\n    summary = []\n    \n    for t in tranches:\n        pct = (t['amount'] / t['cap']) * 100.0\n        total_safe_ownership += pct\n        summary.append((t['name'], t['amount'], t['cap'], pct))\n        \n    founder_remaining_pct = 100.0 - total_safe_ownership\n    total_diluted_shares = int(initial_founder_shares / (founder_remaining_pct / 100.0))\n    \n    return {\n        \"total_safe_pct\": round(total_safe_ownership, 2),\n        \"founder_pct\": round(founder_remaining_pct, 2),\n        \"total_shares\": total_diluted_shares,\n        \"tranches\": summary\n    }\n\nsafe_rounds = [\n    {\"name\": \"Tranche 1 (Friends/Family)\", \"amount\": 250000.0, \"cap\": 4000000.0},\n    {\"name\": \"Tranche 2 (Angel Round)\", \"amount\": 750000.0, \"cap\": 6000000.0},\n    {\"name\": \"Tranche 3 (Seed Extension)\", \"amount\": 1200000.0, \"cap\": 9000000.0}\n]\n\nres = simulate_multi_safe_stack(safe_rounds, 10000000)\nprint(\"Multi-Tranche Post-Money SAFE Stacking Summary:\")\nfor name, amt, cap, pct in res[\"tranches\"]:\n    print(f\"  {name:30s} | ${amt:,.0f} @ ${cap/1e6:.1f}M Cap -> {pct:.2f}%\")\nprint(\"-\" * 60)\nprint(f\"Cumulative SAFE Investor Equity: {res['total_safe_pct']}%\")\nprint(f\"Retained Founder Common Equity:  {res['founder_pct']}%\")\nprint(f\"Fully Diluted Pre-Series A Shares: {res['total_shares']:,}\")",
            "output": "Multi-Tranche Post-Money SAFE Stacking Summary:\n  Tranche 1 (Friends/Family)     | $250,000 @ $4.0M Cap -> 6.25%\n  Tranche 2 (Angel Round)        | $750,000 @ $6.0M Cap -> 12.50%\n  Tranche 3 (Seed Extension)     | $1,200,000 @ $9.0M Cap -> 13.33%\n------------------------------------------------------------\nCumulative SAFE Investor Equity: 32.08%\nRetained Founder Common Equity:  67.92%\nFully Diluted Pre-Series A Shares: 14,723,926\n",
