            "example": "Imagine selling a commercial bakery to a franchisor. The franchisor insists that fifteen percent of the bakery's pantry ingredients must be reserved for new recipe development. If taken out of the pre-money, you must supply those ingredients out of your own personal kitchen before the sale. If taken post-money, the buyer and seller fund the pantry together.",
            "code": "def simulate_option_pool_shuffle(existing_shares: int, pre_money: float, investment: float, target_pool_pct: float):\n    post_money = pre_money + investment\n    investor_pct = investment / post_money\n    \n    # Pre-Money Option Pool: Pool created entirely out of pre-money\n    # Target pool is target_pool_pct of post-money capitalization\n    pre_money_share_price = (pre_money * (1.0 - target_pool_pct)) / existing_shares\n    new_pool_shares_pre = int((target_pool_pct * post_money) / pre_money_share_price)\n    fd_pre = existing_shares + new_pool_shares_pre\n    investor_shares_pre = int(investment / pre_money_share_price)\n    post_shares_pre = fd_pre + investor_shares_pre\n    founder_pct_pre = (existing_shares / post_shares_pre) * 100.0\n    \n    # Post-Money Option Pool: Pool created after investment, diluting both\n    clean_share_price = pre_money / existing_shares\n    investor_shares_clean = int(investment / clean_share_price)\n    interim_shares = existing_shares + investor_shares_clean\n    new_pool_shares_post = int((target_pool_pct / (1.0 - target_pool_pct)) * interim_shares)\n    post_shares_post = interim_shares + new_pool_shares_post\n    founder_pct_post = (existing_shares / post_shares_post) * 100.0\n    \n    return {\n        \"pre_price\": round(pre_money_share_price, 4),\n        \"post_price\": round(clean_share_price, 4),\n        \"founder_pct_pre\": round(founder_pct_pre, 2),\n        \"founder_pct_post\": round(founder_pct_post, 2),\n        \"founder_delta_pct\": round(founder_pct_post - founder_pct_pre, 2)\n    }\n\nres = simulate_option_pool_shuffle(\n    existing_shares=10000000,\n    pre_money=40000000.0,\n    investment=10000000.0,\n    target_pool_pct=0.15\n)\n\nprint(\"Option Pool Shuffle Mathematical Comparison:\")\nprint(f\"  Standard Pre-Money Pool Price:  ${res['pre_price']:.4f}/share -> Founder Retains: {res['founder_pct_pre']}%\")\nprint(f\"  Equitable Post-Money Pool Price: ${res['post_price']:.4f}/share -> Founder Retains: {res['founder_pct_post']}%\")\nprint(\"-\" * 65)\nprint(f\"Founder Equity Surrendered to Pre-Money Shuffle: {res['founder_delta_pct']}% of Enterprise!\")\nprint(f\"Economic Value Shifted from Founders to VC: ${res['founder_delta_pct'] * 500000:,.2f}\")",
