                "In Part 4, we program an Institutional Pro-Forma Series A Iterative Convergence Engine in Python. We will write a robust numerical solver that resolves circular references between pre-money option pools, multi-tranche seed conversions, and Series A preferred share issuances, outputting fully reconciled institutional capitalization tables with zero mathematical discrepancy."
