            "example": "Imagine a commercial real estate partnership where an equity investor receives their initial capital back from the building's sale, and then also demands thirty percent of all remaining profit. It is a double-dip: the investor gets returned their seed money and then extracts a major share of the harvest.",
            "code": "def compare_participating_waterfalls(investment: float, ownership_pct: float, cap_multiple: float, exit_val: float):\n    # 1. Non-Participating\n    pro_rata = exit_val * (ownership_pct / 100.0)\n    non_part_investor = max(min(investment, exit_val), pro_rata)\n    non_part_common = max(0.0, exit_val - non_part_investor)\n    \n    # 2. Full Participating (Double-Dip)\n    pref_paid = min(investment, exit_val)\n    rem = max(0.0, exit_val - pref_paid)\n    full_part_investor = pref_paid + (rem * (ownership_pct / 100.0))\n    full_part_common = max(0.0, exit_val - full_part_investor)\n    \n    # 3. Capped Participating (e.g., 2x cap)\n    max_cap = investment * cap_multiple\n    capped_investor = min(full_part_investor, max_cap)\n    # If pure conversion yields more than capped participation, investor converts\n    if pro_rata > capped_investor:\n        capped_investor = pro_rata\n    capped_common = max(0.0, exit_val - capped_investor)\n    \n    return {\n        \"non_part_common\": non_part_common,\n        \"full_part_common\": full_part_common,\n        \"capped_common\": capped_common,\n        \"investor_full\": full_part_investor,\n        \"investor_capped\": capped_investor\n    }\n\nex = 30000000.0\nc = compare_participating_waterfalls(10000000.0, 30.0, 2.0, ex)\nprint(f\"Waterfall Comparison at ${ex/1e6:.1f}M Exit ($10M Check for 30% Equity):\")\nprint(\"-\" * 65)\nprint(f\"1. 1x Non-Participating: Common Gets: ${c['non_part_common']/1e6:5.2f}M | VC: ${ex - c['non_part_common']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"2. Full Participating:   Common Gets: ${c['full_part_common']/1e6:5.2f}M | VC: ${c['investor_full']:,.2f}\")\nprint(f\"3. Capped Part (2.0x):   Common Gets: ${c['capped_common']/1e6:5.2f}M | VC: ${c['investor_capped']:,.2f}\")\nprint(\"-\" * 65)\nprint(f\"Founder Wealth Extracted by Full Participation: ${c['non_part_common'] - c['full_part_common']:,.2f}!\")",
            "output": "Waterfall Comparison at $30.0M Exit ($10M Check for 30% Equity):\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\n1. 1x Non-Participating: Common Gets: $20.00M | VC: $10,000,000.00\n2. Full Participating:   Common Gets: $14.00M | VC: $16,000,000.00\n3. Capped Part (2.0x):   Common Gets: $14.00M | VC: $16,000,000.00\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nFounder Wealth Extracted by Full Participation: $6,000,000.00!\n",
