            "code": "def audit_zero_dollar_wipeout(series_a_pref: float, series_b_pref: float, series_c_pref: float, exit_range: list):\n    total_pref_stack = series_a_pref + series_b_pref + series_c_pref\n    print(f\"Total Liquidation Preference Hurdle: ${total_pref_stack/1e6:.1f}M\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    print(\"Exit Value | Total Pref Paid | Common Distribution | Wipeout Status\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    for ex in exit_range:\n        paid_pref = min(ex, total_pref_stack)\n        common_dist = max(0.0, ex - total_pref_stack)\n        if common_dist == 0.0:\n            status = \"CRITICAL ZERO-DOLLAR WIPEOUT\"\n        else:\n            status = \"POSITIVE COMMON REALIZATION\"\n        print(f\"${ex/1e6:5.1f}M     | ${paid_pref/1e6:6.2f}M        | ${common_dist/1e6:6.2f}M              | {status}\")\n\naudit_zero_dollar_wipeout(\n    series_a_pref=10000000.0,\n    series_b_pref=15000000.0,\n    series_c_pref=15000000.0,\n    exit_range=[20000000.0, 35000000.0, 40000000.0, 50000000.0, 75000000.0]\n)",
            "output": "Total Liquidation Preference Hurdle: $40.0M\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nExit Value | Total Pref Paid | Common Distribution | Wipeout Status\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\n$ 20.0M     | $ 20.00M        | $  0.00M              | CRITICAL ZERO-DOLLAR WIPEOUT\n$ 35.0M     | $ 35.00M        | $  0.00M              | CRITICAL ZERO-DOLLAR WIPEOUT\n$ 40.0M     | $ 40.00M        | $  0.00M              | CRITICAL ZERO-DOLLAR WIPEOUT\n$ 50.0M     | $ 40.00M        | $ 10.00M              | POSITIVE COMMON REALIZATION\n$ 75.0M     | $ 40.00M        | $ 35.00M              | POSITIVE COMMON REALIZATION\n",
