      "example": "Consider a software conglomerate with profitable subsidiaries across Asia paying corporate income taxes at seventeen percent. By running an algorithmic GILTI optimizer, the American parent models the Section 250 deduction and eighty-percent foreign tax credit, confirming zero residual American corporate tax liability.",
      "code": "def optimize_gilti_and_foreign_tax_credits(foreign_tested_income: float, qbai_asset_basis: float, foreign_effective_tax_rate: float):\n    # IRC Section 951A GILTI & Section 960 Deemed Paid FTC:\n    # NDTIR = 10% of QBAI\n    # Net GILTI = Tested Income - NDTIR\n    # Sec 78 Gross-Up = 80% of foreign taxes paid\n    # Sec 250 Deduction = 50% of (GILTI + Sec 78 Gross-Up)\n    # Residual US Tax = Tentative US Tax (21%) - Deemed Paid FTC\n    \n    ndtir = qbai_asset_basis * 0.10\n    gilti_inclusion = max(0.0, foreign_tested_income - ndtir)\n    foreign_taxes_paid = foreign_tested_income * foreign_effective_tax_rate\n    deemed_paid_ftc = foreign_taxes_paid * 0.80\n    \n    sec_78_gross_up = deemed_paid_ftc\n    taxable_gilti_base = gilti_inclusion + sec_78_gross_up\n    sec_250_deduction = taxable_gilti_base * 0.50\n    net_us_taxable_base = taxable_gilti_base - sec_250_deduction\n    \n    tentative_us_tax = net_us_taxable_base * 0.21\n    residual_us_tax = max(0.0, tentative_us_tax - deemed_paid_ftc)\n    breakeven_satisfied = foreign_effective_tax_rate >= 0.13125\n    \n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    print(\"ALGORITHMIC IRC SECTION 951A GILTI & FTC OPTIMIZER\")\n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Foreign Subsidiaries Tested Operating Income:    ${foreign_tested_income:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Qualified Business Asset Investment (QBAI):      ${qbai_asset_basis:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Routine Tangible Return Deduction (10% QBAI):   -${ndtir:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Net GILTI Inclusion:                             ${gilti_inclusion:14,.2f}\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Foreign Corporate Taxes Paid (Rate {foreign_effective_tax_rate*100:.2f}%):    ${foreign_taxes_paid:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Section 960 Deemed Paid FTC (80% Credit):        ${deemed_paid_ftc:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Section 78 Gross-Up Tax Base:                    ${taxable_gilti_base:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Section 250 Statutory Deduction (50% Relief):   -${sec_250_deduction:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Tentative US Corporate Tax (21% Rate):           ${tentative_us_tax:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"Foreign Tax Credit Offset Applied:              -${deemed_paid_ftc:14,.2f}\")\n    print(\"-\" * 65)\n    print(f\"Net Residual US Federal Tax Liability:           ${residual_us_tax:14,.2f}\")\n    print(f\"13.125% Breakeven Threshold Parity:              {'[MET: ZERO US RESIDUAL TAX]' if breakeven_satisfied else '[UNMET: TAX SHORTFALL]'}\")\n    print(\"=\" * 65)\n    return round(residual_us_tax, 2)\n\nres_tax = optimize_gilti_and_foreign_tax_credits(8000000.0, 500000.0, 0.17)",
      "output": "=================================================================\nALGORITHMIC IRC SECTION 951A GILTI & FTC OPTIMIZER\n=================================================================\nForeign Subsidiaries Tested Operating Income:    $  8,000,000.00\nQualified Business Asset Investment (QBAI):      $    500,000.00\nRoutine Tangible Return Deduction (10% QBAI):   -$     50,000.00\nNet GILTI Inclusion:                             $  7,950,000.00\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nForeign Corporate Taxes Paid (Rate 17.00%):    $  1,360,000.00\nSection 960 Deemed Paid FTC (80% Credit):        $  1,088,000.00\nSection 78 Gross-Up Tax Base:                    $  9,038,000.00\nSection 250 Statutory Deduction (50% Relief):   -$  4,519,000.00\nTentative US Corporate Tax (21% Rate):           $    948,990.00\nForeign Tax Credit Offset Applied:              -$  1,088,000.00\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nNet Residual US Federal Tax Liability:           $          0.00\n13.125% Breakeven Threshold Parity:              [MET: ZERO US RESIDUAL TAX]\n=================================================================\n",
