        "We now advance to Part 4: DEMPE-Compliant Cost Sharing Arrangement & Intangible Profit Allocator. The ultimate strategic determinant of enterprise value is the allocation of intellectual property returns. In our tri-jurisdictional architecture, new software algorithms, machine learning models, and patented inventions are co-developed across international borders. To ensure that intellectual property ownership is legally recognized and shielded from international tax disputes, the group deploys a Treasury Regulation Section 1.482-7 Cost Sharing Arrangement (CSA) harmonized with OECD BEPS Actions 8-10 DEMPE guidelines.",
